# Phase 1 local/manual features require no environment variables.
# All VITE_* variables are rejected by vite.config.ts to prevent credential exposure.
# Future server-only credentials (not consumed by this frontend):
# NAVER_SEARCHAD_API_KEY, NAVER_SEARCHAD_SECRET_KEY, NAVER_SEARCHAD_CUSTOMER_ID
# NAVER_API_HUB_CLIENT_ID, NAVER_API_HUB_CLIENT_SECRET
# See server/README.md. Do not store real values in this example or browser code.
